{"abihu_33":{"bio":"Father of Him; i.e., “worshipper of God”, the second of the sons of Aaron (Ex. 6:23; Num. 3:2; 26:60; 1 Chr. 6:3). Along with his three brothers he was consecrated to the priest’s office (Ex. 28:1). With his father and elder brother he accompanied the seventy elders part of the way up the mount with Moses (Ex. 24:1, 9). On one occasion he and Nadab his brother offered incense in their censers filled with “strange” (i.e., common) fire, i.e., not with fire taken from the great brazen altar (Lev. 6:9, etc.), and for this offence they were struck dead, and were taken out and buried without the camp (Lev. 10:1-11; comp. Num. 3:4; 26:61; 1 Chr. 24:2). It is probable that when they committed this offence they were intoxicated, for immediately after is given the law prohibiting the use of wine or strong drink to the priests.","father":["aaron_1"],"mother":["elisheba_1162"],"siblings":["ithamar_649","eleazar_1062","nadab_2128"],"children":[],"partners":[],"refs":["Exo.6.23","Exo.24.1","Exo.24.9","Exo.28.1","Lev.10.1","Num.3.2","Num.3.4","Num.26.60-61","1Ch.6.3","1Ch.24.1-2"],"events":[]},"adaiah_1592":{"bio":"Timely (1 Chr. 6:21). A Gershonite Levite.","also":"Iddo","father":["ethan_1622"],"mother":[],"siblings":[],"children":["zerah_3045"],"partners":[],"refs":["1Ch.6.21","1Ch.6.41"],"events":[]},"ashbel_336":{"father":["benjamin_463"],"mother":[],"siblings":["ahiram_158","ard_293","becher_423","bela_436","jediael_757","ehi_1038","gera_1298","huram_1569","shupham_2115","nohah_2120","rapha_2447"],"children":[],"partners":[],"refs":["Gen.46.21","Num.26.38","1Ch.8.1"],"events":[]},"azaz_546":{"father":["shema_2615"],"mother":[],"siblings":[],"children":["bela_435"],"partners":[],"refs":["1Ch.5.8"],"events":[]},"balak_387":{"bio":"Empty; spoiler, a son of Zippor, and king of the Moabites (Num. 22:2, 4). From fear of the Israelites, who were encamped near the confines of his territory, he applied to Balaam (q.v.) to curse them; but in vain (Josh. 24:9).","als